{
  "_about": "Footpath entrances and crosswalks, and Ungroup (the user, 22 Oct: every pedestrian entrance made a crosswalk across the street; let the game join the path; a build should be ungroupable). Footpaths without a crosswalk stop at the kerb and the game joins them (lab streetJoins: 'kerb'); entrances placed with the Crosswalk switch split the street and get one ('split', crosswalk). Parks on a city block and on land drawn up to the street, a car park's footpath, a strip mall's footpath, a plaza and a hiking trail; then a park ungrouped from its info panel (dissolved for good), and one built with 'One group' off, each time clicking a tree with the game's own tool (lab pickPart). Send with: powershell -File tools/suite/Send-Suite.ps1 -File suite/scenarios/entrance-crosswalks.json -Build -Who <you>",
